name collargs
category Package
revision 70689
shortdesc Collect arguments of any command
longdesc This is a cross-format package providing a command which can
longdesc determine the argument scope of any command whose argument
longdesc structure conforms to xparse's argument specification. It was
longdesc implemented as an auxiliary package of Advice ... which in turn
longdesc was implemented as an auxiliary package of Memoize. This is why
longdesc it is, somewhat unconventionally, documented alongside that
longdesc package. This applies to both the manual and the documented
longdesc code listing.
